              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzalo yakho yayingangesihlabathi, nenzalo yezibilini zakho njengamatshe aso; igama lakhe aliyikunqunywa, lingachithwa phambi kobuso bami.",
          "type": "text",
