              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phumani eBhabhiloni, nibalekele amaKaledi, nimemezele ngezwi lokuhlabelela, nikumemezele, nikumemezele emikhawulweni yomhlaba; anothi: UJehova uhlengile inceku yakhe uJakobe.",
          "type": "text",
